										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>After a while I&#8217;m going to write in my blog. This time in English.</p>
<p>At first because of improving my English writing skills by practicing and have any feedback from others.</p>
<p>Some other reason of writing in my blog is to improve my personal branding and notice everyone who cared about me (or not) to check <a href="https://github.com/hmdshariati">my Github account</a>.</p>
<p>Recently I&#8217;ve started some new repositories and hope to be success to have a good challenge this year:<br />
